* ALTERNATE DEVICE CANDIDATE: Sylvania 6BC8 5-parameter Koren plate curves
* Parameter origin: Wayne Clay 2014 Sylvania datasheet fit as quoted on diyAudio.
* https://www.diyaudio.com/community/threads/vacuum-tube-spice-models.243950/page-115
* Published fit reports mean error 0.36045mA to scanned Sylvania plate curves.
* This is an independent SPICE implementation of a published parameter set;
* not a validated 436B installed tube or evidence of authentic RS124 output.
.subckt V6BC8_ALT P G K
* Vp/Vg and three empirical Koren terms: KG=54.16463004,
* KP=1.794225622, KV=0.9222704089k, EX=1.439822572,
* G=0.02019891536m.
BPL P K I={20.19891536u*pow(uramp(V(P,K)*ln(1+exp(1.794225622*(1+54.16463004*V(G,K)/sqrt(922.2704089+V(P,K)*V(P,K)))))/1.794225622),1.439822572)}
RPK P K 1G
CGK G K 3.9p
CGP G P 3.7p
CPK P K 1.8p
.ends V6BC8_ALT
